text After work is over, we go back to the office, and I go to change. Just then...
sound MSO.aac
text @[Boss]
text Hmm, we don't have enough time.
sound MSP.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Should we add some night shifts?
sound MSQ.aac
text @[Boss]
text That'd be asking too much.
text I hear Yoshino-san and the boss speaking in back.
text It looks like the work schedule is getting tight, and there aren't enough people to fill it.
sound MSR.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Okazaki.
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah, what's up?
text I poke my head out as I'm zipping up my jeans when they call my name.
