text @[Yoshino]
text What about Sunday?
text This Sunday is the Founder's Festival. I have to take that day off.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'm sorry. If it's possible, I'd like to have Sunday off.
text Yoshino-san says "okay," then looks back at the schedule.
