text @[Yoshino]
text All we need to do today is to switch out a bulb and do some cleaning, right?
text @[Tomoya]
text Yeah, looks like it.
text I reply while I check our sales slips.
text We stop the car out of the way to check our materials and tools.
sound MT1.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Okazaki, you go ahead and remove the bulb.
text @[Tomoya]
text Got it.
