text I start loosening the cord that's tying the ladder down in the truck bed.
text I've done this countless times before.
text By now, I think I can practically do the work and the cleanup myself.
music ~
text Unfortunately though, I'm not so lucky with today's work site.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...What am I supposed to do about this?
text Seeing the site, all I can do is blink in astonishment.
music BGM28.mp3
text To any other worker, this would be a completely average task.
text But I just can't find any good footing today, and I'm not able to put the ladder up on the right side.
text This would be an easy job if I could just place the ladder on the left side and reach out with my right arm.
text Until now, I've been able to intentionally go around to the opposite side and do it with my left hand alone.
text But with no other option, I have to force myself into an impossible position to do the work.
text Even so, I can't even reach the case surrounding the street light itself.
text In order to get it off, I'd have to affix the entire ladder onto the telephone pole with a safety belt and hang off of it.
sound MT2.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Something wrong?
text @[Tomoya]
text N-No. It's nothing.
text I must seem strange to Yoshino-san, hesitating up on the ladder as I am.
text I make up my mind.
text I stretch the safety belt I have in my pocket out as far as it can go and attach the ladder onto the telephone pole.
text I then affix the hook on my stomach to the top of it so that it won't come off.
text That way, even in the absolute worst case scenario, I'll just be stuck hanging in mid-air.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Okay.
text All that's left is to stretch my body out as far as it'll go.
sound MT3.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Okazaki. Hold on a second.
text @[Tomoya]
text Y-Yes?
sound MT4.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text You'll wreck your abdominal muscles if you slip off and fall.
text @[Tomoya]
text Huh?
sound MT5.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Get off there right now.
text @[Tomoya]
text What? What do you mean?
sound MT6.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text You can't lift your right arm up, can you?
text I'm confused by all that he's just said.
sound MT7.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Hurry up.
text @[Tomoya]
text O-Okay...
text I climb down the ladder as I'm told.
music ~
text Yoshino-san winds up doing all the work at the site himself, in the end.
text All I can manage is to bring him materials and carry tools back and forth.
if 0 == 0
	goto s368
fi
