sound C.aac
text As we're heading to the next location...
music BGM08D.mp3
text @[Tomoya]
text ...How did you know?
text I ask him.
sound MT8.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Know what?
text @[Tomoya]
text That... I can't lift my right arm.
text If he tells me I need to quit the job because of it, I won't be able to argue with him.
text And yet, he's said nothing about it this entire time; I want to know why.
sound MT9.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text I could tell by looking at you.
text @[Tomoya]
text Then why didn't you say anything earlier?
sound MTA.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text What would be the point? I mean, does it seem like it'll ever heal?
text @[Tomoya]
text N-No.
sound MTB.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Then what's the problem?
text @[Tomoya]
text It's not good. That's the problem.
sound MTC.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Calm down.
text @[Tomoya]
text I'd been hiding the fact that my shoulder was messed up for all this time.
sound MTD.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text But you still did your best, right?
text I raise my head.
text It sounds like he's simply praising me right now.
sound MTE.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text It's true that I don't think this job is the best for someone who can't lift their arm.
sound MTF.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text But you've been working at it for all this time, even trying to take care of situations that seem hopeless all by yourself.
sound MTG.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text I've been watching you since the beginning.
text He'd even noticed that...?
text @[Tomoya]
text Thank you very much.
text I'm nearly in tears as I thank him.
sound MTH.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Don't go thanking me, you idiot.
sound MTI.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text I haven't done anything that you need to thank me for. In fact, I couldn't do anything like that, because of you.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Huh?
sound MTJ.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text I couldn't have helped you even if I wanted to simply because you kept working on your own.
sound MTK.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text You ought to ask me next time, though.
text @[Tomoya]
text But...
sound MTL.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Why do you think I'm here?
text @[Tomoya]
text I don't want to inconvenience you any more than I already have...
sound MTM.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Listen, I've never once thought that you were "inconveniencing" me.
sound MTN.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text So don't be afraid to ask me.
sound MTO.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text After all, I can't do anything all on my own either.
sound MTP.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text That's why I have the boss, all the other guys, and you.
sound MTQ.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text That's how work is. You ask for help when there's something you can't do.
sound MTR.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text And that's when you say things like what you just said.
sound MTS.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text That's when you thank people.
text I quietly mumble in agreement.
text I don't know whether or not he hears me.
text But it looks like Yoshino-san nods back.
