text @[Tomoya]
text Is that okay?
sound MTZ.aac
text @[Johny]
text Listen, boy. You shouldn't be so concerned when people try to give you things.
text @[Tomoya]
text All right. Well, thank you very much.
text I hadn't noticed until now because I'd never spoken to these guys before, but they may be more interesting than I initially thought.
