text I open it to find a set of brand new tools.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Is it okay for me to use these?
sound MU5.aac
text @[Yoshino]
text Are you going to wear a belt with no tools to go with it?
text @[Tomoya]
text Th-Thank you.
